tation in WikiProteins</article-title><source>Genome Biology</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>R89</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18507872</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/gb-2008-9-5-r89</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>